## Decomposition Principles

**Good Subtasks**: Independent, concrete, scoped, testable, atomic
**Avoid**: Sequential dependencies, vague goals, over-granular (10+), duplicate work

### Think in Terms of:
- Vertical slices (end-to-end features)
- Horizontal layers (Infrastructure / Application / Presentation)
- Phases (Research → Design → Implementation → Testing)

### Subtask Count
{% if max_subtasks %}- Maximum {{ max_subtasks }} subtasks (hard limit)
{% endif %}- Optimal: 2-3 subtasks
- Avoid 1 subtask (should be WORKER instead)

## Model & Temperature Selection

| Task Type | Model | Temperature |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Complex reasoning | gpt-4o, claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022 | 0.5-0.7 |
| Creative/design | gpt-4o | 0.7-0.9 |
| Research/analysis | gpt-4o-mini | 0.3-0.5 |
| Classification/factual | gpt-4o-mini | 0.1-0.3 |
| Default | gpt-4o-mini | 0.5 |

**Default tool**: {{ default_tool }}

